# ⚖️ Day 48 – Compare & Decide Builder

> **Research-Backed Decision Intelligence Platform Powered by Claude AI**

## 📌 Overview

**Compare & Decide Builder** is an AI-powered decision support application designed to help users confidently compare multiple options using **verified research, transparent citations, and customizable decision criteria**.

Instead of providing fixed rankings or opinion-based recommendations, the application guides users through an interactive questionnaire, researches credible sources, evaluates each option against measurable criteria, and generates a dynamic ranking based on the user's priorities.

Every comparison emphasizes **transparency**, **source attribution**, and **explainable decision-making**.

