## 🧠 Decision Workflow

The application follows a structured research and comparison pipeline.

```text
User Interview
      │
      ▼
Decision Context Collection
      │
      ▼
Criteria Selection
      │
      ▼
Source Discovery
      │
      ▼
Research Verification
      │
      ▼
Comparison Matrix
      │
      ▼
Weighted Scoring Engine
      │
      ▼
Live Ranking Updates
      │
      ▼
Decision Report
```

